[[3,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Operation to be carried out\nwith the vehicle on a lift.</p><p>Lift up the handbrake lever.</p><p><a href=\"#/2891755\">4450D70</a>\n                                           .</p><p>1. Undo the rear wheel hub nut.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2035109.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[3,63,0,"<p>Lower the handbrake lever.</p><p>Raise the car.</p><p><a href=\"#/2891597\">3320B30</a>\n                                           .</p><p>1. Remove the rear wheel hub complete with spacer.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2035110.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[3,63,0,"<aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/769.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>The rear hub bearing should not\nbe dismantled from the hub. If it proves necessary on account of noise\nor excessive clearance, replace the rear hub complete with bearing.</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside>"],[3,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Fit the rear hub, complete\nwith spacers, on the stub axle.</p><p><a href=\"#/2891597\">3320B30</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Lower the vehicle.</p><p>Completely raise the handbrake lever.</p><p>Tighten the rear wheel hub nut to torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Nut</p></td><td><p>REAR WHEEL HUB WITH BEARINGS</p></td><td><p>M22 x 1.5</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>28</p></td></tr></table></div><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/769.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>The rear wheel hub nut should\nbe replaced at each dismantling.</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside><p>Lower the handbrake lever.</p><p><a href=\"#/2891755\">4450D70</a>\n                                           .</p>"]]